# Project Structure Guide

This project is a Nuxt.js 3 application with a focus on user management, security, and auditability. The main directories and files are:

- [nuxt.config.js](mdc:nuxt.config.js): Nuxt configuration and module setup
- [package.json](mdc:package.json): Project dependencies and scripts
- [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma): Database schema (MySQL, managed by Prisma)
- [server/api/](mdc:server/api): Server-side API endpoints (authentication, dev tools, etc.)
- [pages/](mdc:pages): Frontend pages (login, dashboard, audit, etc.)
- [components/](mdc:components): Vue components for UI
- [composables/](mdc:composables): Reusable logic and utilities
- [stores/](mdc:stores): Pinia stores for state management
- [middleware/](mdc:middleware): Route protection and middleware logic
- [assets/](mdc:assets): Static assets (images, styles)
- [public/](mdc:public): Publicly served files

The entry point for the app is [app.vue](mdc:app.vue).
